OL,3,ARenoir paintings worth millions stolen
OL,4,Ain French museum heist
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe paintings, each worth bB,9m (#7.7m;
OL,7,F$10.4m), are the latest high-profile
OL,8,Fpieces to have been stolen in a string
OL,9,Fof recent heists in Europe which have
OL,10,Fthrust the security of art in galleries
OL,11,Fand museums into the spotlight.
OL,13,FOne of the most high-profile was in
OL,14,FOctober last year, when a brazen heist
OL,15,Fat the Louvre Museum in Paris saw
OL,16,FFrance's priceless crown jewels being
OL,17,Fstolen.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
